 first train Jin q and Misan  find the body of the woman who had gone  to the bathroom to smoke the corpse  looks like the woman was terrified to  death Jin Q hurriedly tries to inform  the central office while Misan retrieves  the dead woman's phone she finds several  unread messages from the woman's  boyfriend suggesting she get off the  train immediately apparently he had seen  some spirits on the train after he had  gotten off taken aback Misan leaves the  corpse and walks out suddenly the train  starts transforming into an old one once  again Misan sees the same unknown  stewardess who tells her that she made a  mistake working on that train the  stewardess then tells a confused and  anxious me son that they are all going  to die distressed me son starts  screaming at the stewardess but in  reality it turns out that she is  screaming at her lady supervisor after  that Misan Falls unconscious on the  floor while unconscious she sees a  vision where it is revealed that the  unknown stewardess worked on the train  that crashed 15 years ago her name was  Jung Jin Sook and while on duty she had  mistakenly kicked a bottle of poison  destroying it completely but before we  get to know more Misan regains her  Consciousness later she talks about her  visions and dreams with Jin q but the  latter is confused and doesn't  understand any of it Misan then decides  to ask for help from suhee the psychic  as the two talk so he reveals that she  too has been feeling a strange Aura ever  since the train stopped at the last  station the pair then go to the restroom  where the dead woman's body lies so he  tries to go near the corpse but she  starts feeling uncomfortable as if  something is stopping her elsewhere we  see heiju and her boyfriend they are the  same couple that we saw at the start of  the movie who are on their way to their  honeymoon from their conversation we  learned that hiju is the same girl among  the two children that survived the  accident 15 years ago mean